            <semantic:documentation>&lt;p&gt;A Product is an item stored in the warehouse, ready to be sold or shipped. Each product has attributes like a unique identifier (ProductID), name, description, category, price, and weight. Products can be classified into different types such as perishable, non-perishable, or fragile.&lt;/p&gt;</semantic:documentation>
